== Trivia ==
* Because a note block is a wooden-type block, a note block directly on top of another one produces a string bass sound when playing notes.
* {{IN|java}}, note blocks have the highest number of possible block state combinations, at 1350, beating [[fire]]'s 512 and [[redstone dust]]'s 1296.

